{"id": "W01", "split": "train", "scenario_id": "workflow_lte_mcs_tbs_train", "question": "LTE PDSCH 使用 PDSCH MCS 表，MCS 索引为 18、分配 18 个 PRB、单层传输。请先查出调制方式和 I_TBS，再依据查得的 I_TBS 计算传输块大小（比特）。", "source_ref": "repo:tools/lte_mcs.schema.json", "steps": [{"tool": "lte_mcs", "arguments": {"imcs": "18", "table": "PDSCH"}, "expected": {"table": "PDSCH", "imcs": 18, "itbs": 16, "mod": "64QAM", "rv": 0}}, {"tool": "lte_tbs", "arguments": {"nprb": 18, "itbs": "16", "smnlayer": 1}, "bindings": [{"argument": "itbs", "from_step": 0, "path": "/itbs", "format": "string"}], "expected": {"nprb": 18, "itbs": 16, "smnlayer": 1, "tbs": 5992}}], "answer_fields": {"mod": {"step": 0, "path": "/mod"}, "itbs": {"step": 0, "path": "/itbs"}, "tbs": {"step": 1, "path": "/tbs"}}, "kind": "tool_workflow", "origin_type": "expert_authored", "reviewer": "PENDING_BUSINESS_REVIEW", "review_status": "draft"}
{"id": "W02", "split": "selection", "scenario_id": "workflow_nr_mcs_tbs_selection", "question": "5G NR 采用 QAM256 MCS 表的索引 21、32 个 PRB、每 PRB 132 个 RE、单层传输。请先查调制方式和目标码率，再用查得的值计算传输块大小（比特）。", "source_ref": "repo:tools/nr_mcs_tables.schema.json", "steps": [{"tool": "nr_mcs_tables", "arguments": {"table": "QAM256Table", "mcs": 21}, "expected": {"mcs_index": 21, "modulation": "256QAM", "qm": 8, "target_code_rate": 0.6943359375, "spectral_efficiency": 5.5547}}, {"tool": "nr_tbs", "arguments": {"modulation": "256QAM", "nlayers": 1, "nprb": 32, "nre-per-prb": 132, "tcr": 0.6943359375}, "bindings": [{"argument": "modulation", "from_step": 0, "path": "/modulation"}, {"argument": "tcr", "from_step": 0, "path": "/target_code_rate"}], "expected": {"modulation": "256QAM", "nlayers": 1, "nPRB": 32, "NREPerPRB": 132, "tcr": 0.6943359375, "xOh": 0, "tbScaling": 1.0, "tbs": 23568}}], "answer_fields": {"modulation": {"step": 0, "path": "/modulation"}, "target_code_rate": {"step": 0, "path": "/target_code_rate"}, "tbs": {"step": 1, "path": "/tbs"}}, "kind": "tool_workflow", "origin_type": "expert_authored", "reviewer": "PENDING_BUSINESS_REVIEW", "review_status": "draft"}
{"id": "W03", "split": "holdout", "scenario_id": "workflow_snr_ber_holdout", "question": "未编码 16QAM 的 Es/N0 为 11 dB。请先按每符号 4 比特换算 Eb/N0，再计算 AWGN 信道下的理论 BER，并给出两个数值。", "source_ref": "repo:tools/convert_snr.schema.json", "steps": [{"tool": "convert_snr", "arguments": {"x": "11", "input_mode": "esno", "output_mode": "ebno", "bits_per_symbol": 4, "coding_rate": 1}, "expected": {"input_mode": "esno", "output_mode": "ebno", "values_db": 4.979400086720376}}, {"tool": "ber_awgn", "arguments": {"ebno_db": "4.979400086720376", "modulation": "qam", "order": 16}, "bindings": [{"argument": "ebno_db", "from_step": 0, "path": "/values_db", "format": "string"}], "expected": {"ber": [0.04221146398240612], "ser": [0.16171862516347257]}}], "answer_fields": {"values_db": {"step": 0, "path": "/values_db"}, "ber": {"step": 1, "path": "/ber"}}, "kind": "tool_workflow", "origin_type": "expert_authored", "reviewer": "PENDING_BUSINESS_REVIEW", "review_status": "draft"}
{"id": "W04", "split": "train", "scenario_id": "workflow_lte_diagnose_validate_train", "question": "某 LTE 链路测得 SNR 9 dB、EVM 8%、BER 0.0008、残余频偏 200 Hz。可用 30 个 PRB，预留 1 dB 裕量，目标 BLER 0.05。请先诊断链路，再给出链路自适应初步建议。一次由外部人员完成的调整，在相同口径下测得调整前吞吐 3.0 Mbps、BER 0.003、时延 27 ms；调整后吞吐 4.0 Mbps、BER 0.0005、时延 24 ms。约束为 BER 不超过 0.001、时延不超过 25 ms。请核验这组前后数据并说明是否建议回滚。", "source_ref": "repo:references/network_optimization_workflow.md", "steps": [{"tool": "radio_link_diagnosis", "arguments": {"snr_db": 9, "evm_percent": 8, "ber": 0.0008, "frequency_offset_hz": 200}, "expected": {"status": "warning", "finding_count": 1, "findings": [{"cause": "noise_or_interference", "severity": "warning", "evidence": {"snr_gap_db": 1.0}, "actions": ["降低 MCS", "检查同频干扰与接收功率", "增加测量样本后重新估计信道"]}], "recommended_next_tool": "降低 MCS"}}, {"tool": "link_adaptation_optimizer", "arguments": {"snr_db": 9, "nprb": 30, "margin_db": 1, "bler_target": 0.05}, "expected": {"recommended_mcs": 10, "itbs": 9, "modulation": "16QAM", "rv": 0, "tbs_bits_per_subframe": 4776, "estimated_peak_mbps": 4.776, "effective_snr_db": 8.0, "margin_db": 1.0, "bler_target": 0.05, "method": "conservative_threshold_plus_3gpp_tables"}}, {"tool": "closed_loop_validator", "arguments": {"before": "{\"throughput\":3.0,\"ber\":0.003,\"latency_ms\":27}", "after": "{\"throughput\":4.0,\"ber\":0.0005,\"latency_ms\":24}", "constraints": "{\"ber\":{\"max\":0.001},\"latency_ms\":{\"max\":25}}"}, "expected": {"accepted": true, "score": 0.4259259259259259, "comparisons": {"ber": {"before": 0.003, "after": 0.0005, "direction": "lower", "improvement_fraction": 0.8333333333333334, "result": "improved"}, "latency_ms": {"before": 27.0, "after": 24.0, "direction": "lower", "improvement_fraction": 0.1111111111111111, "result": "improved"}, "throughput": {"before": 3.0, "after": 4.0, "direction": "higher", "improvement_fraction": 0.3333333333333333, "result": "improved"}}, "constraint_violations": [], "rollback_recommended": false}}], "answer_fields": {"status": {"step": 0, "path": "/status"}, "findings": {"step": 0, "path": "/findings"}, "recommended_mcs": {"step": 1, "path": "/recommended_mcs"}, "accepted": {"step": 2, "path": "/accepted"}, "rollback_recommended": {"step": 2, "path": "/rollback_recommended"}}, "kind": "tool_workflow", "origin_type": "expert_authored", "reviewer": "PENDING_BUSINESS_REVIEW", "review_status": "draft"}
